--
-- The month's company run (payroll_month_runs, one per park group, paying
-- entity and month) and its versions (payroll_run_versions), with the inputs
-- a draft version takes: attendance reviews, component overrides and manual
-- bonuses/deductions. These are stored against the run VERSION and never
-- written to time_entries or timekeeping_issues: the prototype applies run
-- decisions "without changing source attendance" (model.ts:693). The plan
-- placed the run tables in R4's 0025; they land here because R3's preview
-- and its golden check enter run inputs, and R4 adds the lifecycle (confirm,
-- lock, paid, reopen), the frozen snapshot and its immutability triggers.
--
-- Also: OT-bank bookings, the payroll half of leave (a frozen daily rate per
-- unpaid-leave event or exit payout; SCRUM-560 stays the only balance
-- engine) and offboarding dates. Nothing is seeded.
